Cell["\<\
indeed, the symmetry relation is correct! We only need to redefine z3 <-> z4, \
and add a minus sign due to z3\[Wedge]z4 = -z4\[Wedge]z3\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9684156989112225`*^9, 3.9684157081541443`*^9}, {
  3.96841604717614*^9, 
